comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T04:39:54.926Z","harness:claude-code","Fix (2026-11-14, on the pm-gh1713 branch): src/sdk/structured-mutations.ts now treats pm_format_version, claim_principal and test_runs as read-only document keys, like updated_at and author, so the host keeps deriving them. deferred_fields is read-only on update, where writes resolve deferrals, and on create maps to the defer and deferReason options, with distinct reasons joined by '; '. A strict tracker can therefore recreate a mirrored item from its own pm get --json output. Spec: tests/unit/sdk/create-deferrals.spec.ts, the round-trip case driving both the adapter and the built CLI."
